|┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐|
|│▾ MarkdownViewer         MarkdownViewer                                      █│|
|│    Navigation                                                               █│|
|│    Links                One document, two views: the sidebar is the         █│|
|│    Sidebar              document's heading outline, the pane is a TextBrowse█│|
|│                         r over the same TextDocument.                       █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|│                         The outline is TextDocument#outline — the same flat █│|
|│                         heading list the inline TextToc renders, here       █│|
|│                         rebuilt live as a Tree, so it costs the document    █│|
|│                         nothing: no reflow, no undo entries, no moved       █│|
|│                         reading position.                                   █│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│                         Navigation                                          ░│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│                         Arrows move the outline selection; Enter jumps the  ░│|
|│                         browser to the selected heading. The sidebar tracks ░│|
|│                         the document live, so a page being streamed in      ░│|
|│                         grows its outline as headings arrive.               ░│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│                         Anchors identify entries across rebuilds: a heading ░│|
|│                         inserted above shifts every row, but the selection  ░│|
|│                         and collapsed state stay with their headings. A     ░│|
|└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘|
