+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐|
|│skipped level (an h1 straight to an h3) gets a filler node, so the tree      ░│|
|│keeps its shape.                                                             ░│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│Links                                                                        ░│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│In the browser, Tab cycles link focus and Enter follows: a same-document     ░│|
|│anchor like Sidebar scrolls in place, and with a loader set, a cross-page    ░│|
|│link loads a new document — re-pointing the sidebar at its outline.          ░│|
|│                                                                             ░│|
|│History records each step with the reading position it was left at, so       █│|
|│Backspace returns to the exact spot — following an anchor is itself a        █│|
|│history step.                                                                █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|│Sidebar                                                                      █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|│Hide it (show_toc = false) and the browser takes the full width; the         █│|
|│detached outline keeps tracking the document and comes back current. The     █│|
|│divider between the panes is draggable, and toc_width sets the extent a      █│|
|│(re)shown sidebar gets.                                                      █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|│                                                                             █│|
|└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘|
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
